<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112868" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φωστήρ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆρος</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which gives light,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ φ.</span> the <i>lights of heaven,
				stars,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ge.</u>
				14
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Epict.</u>
				p.72
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ δύο φ.,</span> i.e. sun and
			moon, ibid., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Hyp.</u>
				4.72
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαίνεσθε ὡς φωστῆρες ἐν κόσμῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Phil.</u>
					2.15
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>splendour, radiance,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ φ. αὐτῆς ὅμοιος λίθῳ τιμιωτάτῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Apoc.</u>
					21.11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph., of a
			king, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ φ. τῷ ἡμετέρῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
					16.204c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> of the
				<i>eyes,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				110.22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>opening for light, door</i> or <i>window,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
